WEBVTT

00:06:57.767 --> 00:07:00.915
and fundamentally without
him saying anything

00:07:00.939 --> 00:07:03.705
he drives you to do your best work.

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:05.743
He doesn't have to say a word.

00:07:05.767 --> 00:07:07.623
You just want to do great work.

00:07:08.101 --> 00:07:11.112
CA: You might be the person
best placed to answer this question,

00:07:11.136 --> 00:07:12.629
which has puzzled me,

00:07:12.653 --> 00:07:16.135
which is to shed light
on this strange unit of time

00:07:16.159 --> 00:07:18.935
called "Elon time."

00:07:18.959 --> 00:07:22.120
For example, last year,
I asked Elon, you know,

00:07:22.144 --> 00:07:25.588
when Tesla would
auto-drive across America,

00:07:25.612 --> 00:07:27.937
and he said by last December,

00:07:27.961 --> 00:07:32.265
which is definitely true,
if you take Elon time into account.